Z||000017||JohnnyK||04-04-2001||06:12 PM||||Who cares if they are slow, and they aren't that heavy. They are my favourite cars of all time.||||reg||1
Z||000018||saleenfiero||04-04-2001||08:40 PM||||I'm not trying to insult Deloreans, I love 'em to.  They must have an okay top end speed for the beginning of the 80's, hell it did hit at least 90 MPH in back to the future!  Not good but not too bad either!<P>------------------<BR>'86 SE - My car is actually a MacLaren F1 with a Fiero body kit; or not.||||reg||1
